.flex-item {
  min-width: 0; /* Allow shrinking below content size */
  overflow-wrap: break-word; /* For long words/URLs */
  word-break: break-word; /* Fallback for older browsers */
}

/* Or in the container */
.flex-container {
  min-width: 0; /* Sometimes needed on the container too */
}
```

